
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>美食探索地圖｜尋找生活中的好味道</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fffaf5;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        header {
            background: #9c3d26;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffe0a8;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 85px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe1c4, #fff4e5);
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: #8c3521;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #9c3d26;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #702918;
        }

        .section {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 55px 20px;
        }

        .section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #8c3521;
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px #00000012;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .food-picture {
            height: 180px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 75px;
            background: #fbe6d4;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #8c3521;
            font-size: 21px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .price {
            color: #c05b32;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .about {
            background: #f8e9dc;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 45px 20px;
        }

        .about h2 {
            color: #8c3521;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #54291f;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px 15px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header {
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            nav {
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 8px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 35px 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🍜 美食探索地圖</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">首頁</a>
            <a href="#foods">美食推薦</a>
            <a href="#about">關於我們</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>探索美食，享受生活</h2>
        <p>發現巷弄裡的好味道，讓每一餐都充滿驚喜！</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#foods">開始探索美食</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="foods">
        <h2>人氣美食推薦</h2>
        <p class="intro">精選三種人氣美食，找到你最喜歡的味道。</p>

        <div class="cards">

            <article class="card">
                <div class="food-picture">🍜</div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>台式牛肉麵</h3>
                    <p>香濃湯頭搭配軟嫩牛肉，是台灣經典的美食代表。</p>
                    <p class="price">參考價格：NT$180</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="food-picture">🍱</div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>日式精緻料理</h3>
                    <p>豐富食材搭配細膩擺盤，享受簡單又美好的用餐時光。</p>
                    <p class="price">參考價格：NT$250</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="food-picture">🧋</div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>台灣珍珠奶茶</h3>
                    <p>香醇奶茶搭配Q彈珍珠，是逛街、旅行必備的飲品。</p>
                    <p class="price">參考價格：NT$65</p>
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
        <h2>關於美食探索地圖</h2>
        <p>我們喜歡美食、旅行與生活，透過簡單的網站分享好吃、好玩、值得探索的事物。</p>
        <p>希望每個人都能找到屬於自己的美食小天地！</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 美食探索地圖 | AI 網站設計練習</p>
        <p>用美食認識世界，讓生活更加精彩。</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
